---
title: role.seer.first-seek=all (default) で初夜占いに制限なく、 狐を占うと fox_kill 発動
setup: { seer: 1, werewolf: 1, werehamster: 1, villager: 2 }
rules:
  role.seer.first-seek: all
  general.first-victim: none
---
# Alice (seer) が初夜に Carol (妖狐) を占う → fox_kill 発動 → Carol 死亡
# Day 2 で Bob (wolf) 処刑 → wolf 0、 狐死亡 → villager_won

++Alice、Bob、Carol、Dave、Eve
!Alice=占い師
!Bob=人狼
!Carol=妖狐
!Dave=村人
!Eve=村人
!Alice 0夜 占い Carol

# == engine: Night 0 (state.day=1) ==
# fox_kill: Carol (妖狐) が seer 占いで呪殺
# == end ==

Alice→Bob
Carol→Bob
Dave→Bob
Eve→Bob
Bob→Alice

# == engine: Day 2 (state.day=2) ==
# Bob 4 / Alice 1 → execution=Bob → wolf 0 + 狐死亡 → villager_won
# == end ==

